|desc = 
You summon a Rime Wraith inside of you, an intangible creature, that haunts both foes and allies for {{cts|10|20}} turns.

Every turn the wraith will select a new target and jump to it.

When the wraith enters a creature they are covered in hoarfrost for 3 turns:
* if friendly: increases cold resistance by {{cts|5|15%}}, converts all damage done to cold and increases cold damage by {{cts|12|30%}}.
* if hostile: reduces cold resistance by {{cts|5|15%}} and move {{cts|20|40%}} slower

When selecting a target the wraith prefers one that is not affected by hoarfrost if possible.
